  "label": "Religious Intolerance Hypocrisy",
  "description": "The meme critiques the selective application of tolerance, where individuals or groups show intolerance toward other religions but expect the highest level of tolerance for their own. This concept is rooted in real-world discussions about religious freedom, sectarianism, and double standards in religious communities, often used to highlight perceived hypocrisy in religious or political discourse.",
